{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Hear, O Israel — you draw near today to battle.</b> In the merit of שמע ישראל, which is the portion of unity, you prevail. <b>Do not fear.</b> In the heart. <b>And do not hasten.</b> A term of speed joined with fear, in the manner of what is written (I Samuel 23:26): ״נחפז ללכת״. <b>And do not tremble.</b> In deed."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:49:34.708214541Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}